| Differentiation | {differentiation_score}/25 |
| Risk Level (higher = safer) | {risk_level_score}/25 |
| **Total** | **{total_score}/100** |

**Verdict:** {verdict}
**Confidence:** {confidence}
**One-line take:** {one_line_verdict}

---

